    <string name="how_to_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="how_to">Play audio in any app (YouTube, Telegram, a browser…) and hit Start dubbing. The app taps the phone playback, dubs it in real time and, when you stop, saves the audio and subtitles named after the video.</string>
    <string name="credit">Built by QW-AI-Code</string>
